          "path": "_m/q/z/u/y/raja-ampat-islands-wp/santa-claus-pygmy-raja.jpg",
          "filename": "Raja Ampat Santa Claus Pygmy Seahorse.jpg",
          "caption": "Santa Claus Pygmy in Raja Ampat. There is a very special little seahorse who lives in Raja Ampat, The Santa Claus pygmy seahorse is actually a special colour variation of the Denise pygmy seahorse (Hippocampus denise). In Raja Ampat you have a chance to see four different types of pygmy seahorse. All of them tiny and all of them really hard to find!! The largest adult pygmy seahorse measures less than 3 cm.",
          "alt": "Santa Claus Pygmy in Raja Ampat. There is a very special little seahorse who lives in Raja Ampat, The Santa Claus pygmy seahorse is actually a special colour variation of the Denise pygmy seahorse (Hippocampus denise). In Raja Ampat you have a chance to see four different types of pygmy seahorse. All of them tiny and all of them really hard to find!! The largest adult pygmy seahorse measures less than 3 cm.",
